      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In patients presenting with acute chest pain and suspected acute coronary insufficiency the diagnosis and the decision to admit such patients to a coronary care unit is based on the history, the physical findings and the first electrocardiogram. A diagnostic flow diagram can complement but not substitute clinical judgement."},
